{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/whatwg/html/issues/12257","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/whatwg/html","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/whatwg/html/issues/12257/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/whatwg/html/issues/12257/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/whatwg/html/issues/12257/events","html_url":"https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/12257","id":4065847085,"node_id":"I_kwDOALaj487yV-ct","number":12257,"title":"interaction of \"form element pointer\", fragment parsing, and <template> elements seems incorrect","user":{"login":"dbaron","id":248721,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0ODcyMQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/248721?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dbaron","html_url":"https://github.com/dbaron","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dbaron/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dbaron/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dbaron/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dbaron/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dbaron/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dbaron/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dbaron/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dbaron/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dbaron/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":377109529,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzNzcxMDk1Mjk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/whatwg/html/labels/topic:%20parser","name":"topic: parser","color":"009800","default":false,"description":null,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2026-03-12T16:30:30Z","updated_at":"2026-09-07T13:23:08Z","closed_at":"2026-09-07T13:23:08Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### What is the issue with the HTML Standard?\n\nThe spec has a [form element pointer](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/parsing.html#form-element-pointer) concept.  It attempts to not use this when inside of a `<template>` element.  However, the mechanisms it uses to do this don't appear to interact correctly with fragment parsing, such that the form element pointer can be set and used inside of a `<template>` element when fragment parsing is occurring and the context node for the fragment parsing is itself a `<template>` element or a node in the template document.  (At least assuming I'm looking at these pieces correctly.)\n\nBlink's code appears to do this interaction \"better\" than the spec does, although I just debugged a [bug report](https://issues.chromium.org/490290430) that turns out to be an edge case in that handling.","closed_by":{"login":"annevk","id":1544111,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1NDQxMTE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1544111?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/annevk","html_url":"https://github.com/annevk","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annevk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annevk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annevk/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annevk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annevk/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annevk/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annevk/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annevk/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annevk/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions"